# tree.manifest -- pkg_inventory Linux walk tree (P1c-2). One `<relative-path><TAB><payload>` line per entry;
# payload = T:<text, escapes \n \t \\> (file) | D: (directory) | L:<target> (symlink). Lines starting with '#' are comments.
# The test materializes this under a yuzu_test_pkg_inventory_ TempDir, adds the three P1c-1 real-capture files
# (var/lib/dpkg/arch, etc/apk/repositories, etc/apk/arch) from this directory, and chmods the tool files 0755.
#
# Status: REAL CAPTURE (composite of three command-only container listings; nothing hand-edited)
# host:     braga.local (Apple-silicon Mac, Docker Desktop, linux/arm64 images)
# os:       debian@sha256:f37a335e82bca302e955fa39f9dfe28f1be618f016f8a2b56318e5a5111afc26 (Debian 12 bookworm, aarch64)
#           rockylinux@sha256:d7be1c094cc5845ee815d4632fe377514ee6ebcf8efaed6892889657e5ddaaa6 (Rocky Linux 9.3)
#           alpine@sha256:d9e853e87e55526f6b2917df91a2115c36dd7c696a35be12163d44e6e2a4b6bc (Alpine 3.20)
# identity: root inside each container (docker run --rm, no volumes)
# date:     2026-09-21
# commands: docker run --rm debian:bookworm sh -c 'ls -l /usr/bin/dpkg /usr/bin/apt-get; ls -la /etc/apt/sources.list.d; cat /etc/apt/sources.list.d/*'
#           docker run --rm rockylinux:9 sh -c 'ls -l /usr/bin/rpm /usr/bin/dnf /etc/dnf/dnf.conf; ls -la /etc/yum.repos.d; cat /etc/dnf/dnf.conf'
#           docker run --rm alpine:3.20 sh -c 'ls -l /sbin/apk /etc/apk/repositories /etc/apk/arch'
# What is real: every path below exists in the named image with the mode shown by ls (tools 0755, configs 0644);
#   debian.sources and dnf.conf carry the images' exact text. /etc/apt/sources.list is ABSENT in bookworm (deb822
#   only), so the apt row counts sources_list_lines=0. /usr/bin/dnf is a symlink to dnf-3 in rockylinux:9.
# What is not captured: the tool files are ELF binaries and the four /etc/yum.repos.d/*.repo files hold repo
#   definitions; the leg only tests presence / counts names, so those payloads are empty (T:), not invented text.
usr/bin/dpkg	T:
usr/bin/apt-get	T:
etc/apt/sources.list.d/debian.sources	T:Types: deb\n# http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260918T000000Z\nURIs: http://deb.debian.org/debian\nSuites: bookworm bookworm-updates\nComponents: main\nSigned-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg\n\nTypes: deb\n# http://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian-security/20260918T000000Z\nURIs: http://deb.debian.org/debian-security\nSuites: bookworm-security\nComponents: main\nSigned-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg\n
usr/bin/rpm	T:
usr/bin/dnf-3	T:
usr/bin/dnf	L:dnf-3
etc/dnf/dnf.conf	T:[main]\ngpgcheck=1\ninstallonly_limit=3\nclean_requirements_on_remove=True\nbest=True\nskip_if_unavailable=False\n
etc/yum.repos.d/rocky-addons.repo	T:
etc/yum.repos.d/rocky-devel.repo	T:
etc/yum.repos.d/rocky-extras.repo	T:
etc/yum.repos.d/rocky.repo	T:
sbin/apk	T:
